Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Number five does
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.23,0:00:02.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,the opposite of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,a gentle stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,At secure gates,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:05.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,a steel wall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.90,0:00:06.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,can jump out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.59,0:00:07.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:07.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,in about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:09.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Under the road,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.10,0:00:10.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,a hinged steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:12.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,plate waits inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.34,0:00:13.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,a concrete pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:15.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Hydraulic pistons swing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,its front edge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,up, nearly three
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.49,0:00:18.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,feet high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.57,0:00:19.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,A car that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:20.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits it doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:20.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,just bounce off
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,the steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:23.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thick struts push
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:24.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,the crash down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.05,0:00:24.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,into tons of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:25.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,buried concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:27.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,So the car
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,stops dead, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,its back end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:29.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,flips into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:31.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tested ones can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:32.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop a fifteen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:34.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,thousand pound truck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.12,0:00:34.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,going fifty.
